      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A cable into a knob takes it over. The Oscillator's Output goes into the Polygon's Radius, so the hexagon breathes: Amplitude is how far it swings, Level the radius it swings around, Speed how many waves a second. Try the Waveform: Triangle, Square, Sawtooth. The trace on the Oscillator draws what it sends."
        }
      },
